imiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وكذلك قوله: {فذكر إنما أنت مذكر لست عليهم بمصيطر} [الغاشية: 21 - 22] فقوله: {لست عليهم بمصيطر} لم ينف كونه مع التذكير مبشرا وهاديا وداعيا.<cite>«الرد على السبكي في مسألة تعليق الطلاق» 1/466</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s88a21\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/88-17.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (88:17)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/88-22.html\">Aya ta gaba (88:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/88-22.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Ghaashiya 88:22 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ba ka zama mai ĩkon tanƙwasãwa a kansu ba.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-22.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Ghaashiya 88:22 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ba ka zama mai ĩkon tanƙwasãwa a kansu ba.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ghaashiya\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/88.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 22\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-22.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/88.html\">Sura Al-Ghaashiya</a> › Aya 22</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Ghaashiya 88:22</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿لَّسْتَ عَلَيْهِم بِمُصَيْطِرٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ba ka zama mai ĩkon tanƙwasãwa a kansu ba.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">لم ينف كونه مع التذكير مبشرا وهاديا وداعيا.<cite>«الرد على السبكي في مسألة تعليق الطلاق» 1/466</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا من المنقطع لا بالاعتبار الذي ذكره ابن خروف من كون المستثنى جملة مستقلة بل باعتبار آخر وهو أنه ليس المراد إثبات السيطرة على الكفار فإن الله سبحانه بعثه نذيرا مبلغا لرسالات ربه فمن أطاعة فله الجنة ومن عصاه فله النار<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote><h3>Abin da ya ruwaito daga wasu</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">المفسرون</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «المعنى أنك لم ترسل مسلطا عليهم قاهرا لهم جبارا كالملوك بل أنت عبدي ورسولي المبلغ رسالاتي فمن أطاعك فله الجنة ومن عصاك فله النار»<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s88a22\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/88-21.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (88:21)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/88-23.html\">Aya ta gaba (88:23)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/88-23.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Ghaashiya 88:23 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Fãce dai duk wanda ya jũya bãya, kuma ya kãfirta.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Ghaashiya 88:23 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Fãce dai duk wanda ya jũya bãya, kuma ya kãfirta.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ghaashiya\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/88.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 23\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-23.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/88.html\">Sura Al-Ghaashiya</a> › Aya 23</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Ghaashiya 88:23</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Fãce dai duk wanda ya jũya bãya, kuma ya kãfirta.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا من المنقطع لا بالاعتبار الذي ذكره ابن خروف من كون المستثنى جملة مستقلة بل باعتبار آخر وهو أنه ليس المراد إثبات السيطرة على الكفار<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويوضح هذا أن المخاطبين بهذا الخطاب هم الكفار فلا يصح أن يكونوا هم المستثنين.<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s88a23\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/88-22.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (88:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/88.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Sura Al-Ghaashiya — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsirin Sura Al-Ghaashiya — Ma&#x27;anonin Alkur&#x27;ani a cikin maganganun Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alterna